<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Oct 31 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Oct 31 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $980.8 billion in the week to October 31 from $997.1 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     58.10		54.13</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     31.60		26.56</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  922.70	     942.97</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    183.20	     177.22</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	690.56	     715.17</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    290.24	     281.93</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
